### AI02 unavailable Prolog service
### Preparation: docker compose stop prolog
POST http://localhost:3000/planning/executions
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "forecastName": "Week-45",
  "scenarioName": "Autumn-Scenario",
  "referenceDate": "2026-11-05"
}

### Expected response (502)
{
  "error": {
    "message": "Planning engine unavailable: fetch failed"
  }
}

### Recovery: docker compose start prolog, then repeat the request.
